[75.433777,"o","   or: function [arguments]...\n"]
[75.433795,"o","\n"]
[75.433813,"o","    BusyBox is a multi-call binary that combines many common Unix\n"]
[75.43383,"o","    utilities into a single executable.  Most people will create a\n"]
[75.433848,"o","    link to busybox for each function they wish to use and BusyBox\n"]
[75.433866,"o","    will act like whatever it was invoked as.\n"]
